{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YwLs3oK3EW3X7Yqeb6JMVg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:27.954482+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YwLs3oK3EW3X7Yqeb6JMVg","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1D2lkoibic1wGW8h8ppTtxIPwibHkhwE6YiaqbgqxODicUHsh4YMic4jt2dOS9JoRBare88e814RrhuofcoRLbEYJjtFMlVbNic5Dku2XqprPLvwkM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>为做好2027年接收推荐免试生工作，现开始推免生预报名工作。欢迎校内外优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试攻读武汉大学湖北应用数学中心硕士学位研究生，凡具备申请条件者均可申请预报名，现将有关事项通知如下:</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、招收专业和人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>数据科学（1453S1）专业学位硕士研究生，拟招收推免生人数以学校正式发布的招生目录为准，中心可根据实际情况适当调整预推免计划。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2.本科阶段所在学校为国内外高水平大学。</span></p><p><span>3.学习成绩优异，获得所在学校推免资格；在校期间参加科学研究、全国竞赛等活动表现突出者优先考虑。</span></p><p><span>4.有志于从事数据科学的研究与应用工作，有较强的科研潜力；外语水平良好。</span></p><p><span>5.诚实守信、学风端正，本科期间必修课程均为及格以上，且无任何剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法、违纪、处分记录；入学前未取得学士学位与本科毕业证书者，取消入学资格。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、预报名及复试工作流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）预报名时间与方式</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>8月24日-9月9日23:00</span></span></strong><span>（非我校校园网用户可登录系统时间为每天早7：00-晚23：00），请符合报名条件的申请人登录“武汉大学预推免系统”（网址：yz.whu.edu.cn）（建议使用谷歌浏览器），选择“推免预报名”项目-前沿交叉学科研究院-数据科学。</span></p><p><span>申请人使用个人证件信息完成注册，填写个人信息、学习信息等，并按照系统提示完成材料上传、志愿填报等后续操作。申请人提供的信息若存在弄虚作假，一经发现将取消其资格，后果由申请人本人负责。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>（二）需要提交的材料</span></strong></span></p><section><span>    1.获得推免生资格证明（由所在学校或院系教务部门开具，并签字盖章），如所在学校/学院尚未公布推免资格的考生，需由所在学校或学院教务部门出具相关说明并签字盖章</span></section><p><span>2.专业排名证明（见附件）</span></p><p><span>3.相关电子版材料（含本科成绩单、英语四六级成绩单及其他支撑材料）（命名均为：材料名称+学校+姓名）</span></p><p><strong><span>考生对所提供材料的真实有效性负责，如提供的材料与实际不符，中心将取消其录取资格。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>（三）资格审核及考核</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1.资格审核</span></p><p><span>中心根据学生提交的有效预报名信息和申报材料进行资格审核（优先考虑第一志愿报名数据科学专业的考生），并在预报名系统中发布审核结果，考生须于</span><span><strong><span>9月11日12:00</span></strong></span><span>前通过预报名系统查看报名审核结果并确认。</span></p><p><span>2.考核</span></p><p><span>收到系统考核通知的考生，请实名加入QQ群，群号：808693251 （考核通知发布后开放），加群申请格式为：“姓名+学校”，加群之后务必将群名片修改成“姓名+学校”，便于查找联系。</span></p><p><span>中心考核采用线上方式，具体以QQ群中发布的时间安排为准。</span></p><p><span>中心将综合考虑接收推免生计划、考生学术背景、综合考核成绩排名等因素确定通过预推免的考生名单，考生可于</span><span><strong><span>9月18日</span></strong></span><span>通过预报名系统查看考核结果，已通过中心推免预报名考核的考生，须于</span><span><strong><span>9月18日下午17:00时前</span></strong></span><span>在预报名系统完成确认，否则推免预接收无效。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>（四）注意事项</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1.取得所在学校推免资格的开放日直通营员和本次获得“预推免通过”的推免生，待教育部推免系统开放后在规定时间内及时填报，逾期可能会因全校接收推免生的人数达到预期计划而被拒绝。</span></p><p><span>2.2027年硕士招生专业目录以国家推免服务系统和我校研究生院网站公布的专业目录信息为准。中心将依据教育部和武汉大学研究生招生政策，及时公布2027年接收推免生实施方案，请及时关注相关信息。</span></p><p><span>未尽事宜另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、咨询及联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>咨询电话：</span></p><p><span>027-68761599（工作日 9:00-11:30,14:30-17:30）</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：</span></p><p><span>mds_zs@whu.edu.cn</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1D2lkoibic1wFhP4kfXvcAmOvmEMhELe8Al6NEqKfF484Qv9z2K19pg0MMe3ticldyoxeL0ueYhVQDib1acomPMqBjYpiaf2Rzuknk61L9G3T30M/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>排版 | 吴尚泽    李   瑾</span></p><p><span>审核 | 孙   斐</span></p></section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YwLs3oK3EW3X7Yqeb6JMVg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>专业排名证明模板（推免）.pdf</span></a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YwLs3oK3EW3X7Yqeb6JMVg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>武汉大学湖北应用数学中心接收推免生预报名通知.pdf</span></a></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"cdb2e70b8f3bee186627cb0f7d81185eadd428a031628c4a2b733c074e3f5a08","textLength":1506,"sourceSha256":"438911b909b58f39165e0d09b432033bc3dee72465f7923714c407979276322c","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-434a8071de0b9eca6cd3","title":"2026年武汉大学湖北应用数学中心2026年接收推免生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:27.954482+00:00"}
